### 📐 Unblocking Blueprint for "Implement App Drawer Component"

# UNBLOCKING ARCHITECTURE BLUEPRINT: App Drawer Component

**Status:** `MANDATORY COMPLIANCE REQUIRED`  
**Target:** Master Coder  
**Constraint:** Zero compilation errors, zero `axe` violations, zero flaky tests.

---

## 1. EXACT COMPONENT & INTERFACE SPECIFICATIONS

### 1.1 Primary Component: `AppDrawer`
**File:** `src/components/layout/AppDrawer.tsx`

```typescript
// ==========================================
// TYPES & INTERFACES (COLOCATED)
// ==========================================

export interface NavItem {
  readonly id: string;          // Unique key, matches route path (e.g., '/dashboard')
  readonly label: string;       // Visible text
  readonly icon: React.ReactNode; // Pre-rendered icon node (SVG/Component)
  readonly ariaLabel?: string;  // Optional override for screen readers
}

export interface AppDrawerProps {
  /** Array of navigation items matching the application's route configuration. */
  readonly items: readonly NavItem[];
  /** Current active route pathname (e.g., '/dashboard'). Injected via `useLocation`. */
  readonly activePath: string;
  /** Callback fired when a navigation item is selected. Handles routing + close. */
  readonly onNavigate: (path: string) => void;
  /** Z-index context for portal layering (default: 1200). */
  readonly zIndex?: number;
}

// ==========================================
// HOOK CONTRACTS (IMPLEMENTATION DETAIL)
// ==========================================

/**
 * Manages drawer open/close state with localStorage persistence.
 * Handles focus trapping and restoration.
 */
interface UseDrawerStateReturn {
  readonly isOpen: boolean;
  readonly open: () => void;
  readonly close: () => void;
  readonly toggle: () => void;
  /** Ref for the hamburger trigger button (focus restoration target). */
  readonly triggerRef: React.RefObject<HTMLButtonElement | null>;
  /** Ref for the drawer panel (focus trap target). */
  readonly panelRef: React.RefObject<HTMLDivElement | null>;
}

/**
 * Handles swipe gestures on the MAIN CONTENT AREA (not the hamburger).
 * Returns handlers to attach to the root layout wrapper.
 */
interface UseSwipeGestureReturn {
  readonly onTouchStart: React.TouchEventHandler<HTMLDivElement>;
  readonly onTouchMove: React.TouchEventHandler<HTMLDivElement>;
  readonly onTouchEnd: React.TouchEventHandler<HTMLDivElement>;
}
```

### 1.2 Internal Components (Private, same file)
*   `DrawerPanel`: The sliding `<aside>` element. Role=`navigation`.
*   `DrawerOverlay`: Backdrop `<div>`. Click closes drawer. `aria-hidden="true"`.
*   `NavList`: `<nav>` wrapper containing `NavItem` components.
*   `NavItemComponent`: Individual `<button>` (not `<a>`) for SPA navigation.

